{"id":5576,"date":"2025-09-18T00:17:24","date_gmt":"2025-09-17T17:17:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5576"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:27:49","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:27:49","slug":"tiktok-pixel-la-gi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/tiktok-pixel-la-gi\/","title":{"rendered":"TikTok Pixel l\u00e0 g\u00ec? C\u00e1ch c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng chi ti\u1ebft"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"NF5Pdepsmozsj0xYSLOly3cVggg\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M9hdd2h1Kol7u3xMBYDlmXhlgah\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok \u0111\u1ec3 k\u00e9o traffic v\u1ec1 website c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh, l\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u00f3 th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 mang l\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng hay kh\u00f4ng? TikTok Pixel ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 c\u00e2u tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 thi\u1ebft y\u1ebfu gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i d\u1eef li\u1ec7u gi\u1eefa TikTok v\u00e0 website, l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng cho m\u1ecdi quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean con s\u1ed1. Vi\u1ec7c c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00e0nh th\u1ea1o Pixel l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu trong c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 tri\u1ec3n khai b\u1edfi c\u00e1c chuy\u00ean gia t\u1ea1i <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rim6dnvYMoBVkvxrNZYl1Do5gff\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZshgdSujKoBmcnxNJwQlB9aDgue\">TikTok Pixel l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GFRpd6L38o0TdSxGJTelQ60fgwd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-MUNCd0WuGoHpDExhOrRl7pgKgec\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2a55d414-9448-4e95-bd84-eea50c5023cb&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJyU9bY90yokbvgxJAl0l1w7RgOh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;JyU9bY90yokbvgxJAl0l1w7RgOh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:147095,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5577\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5577\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5577\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-45.png\" alt=\"TikTok Pixel l\u00e0 g\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-45.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-45-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-45-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-45-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-45-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5577\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>TikTok Pixel l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V8dxdiwWDo6shkxGmzil22olg7g\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQQpdpzf9oyUL4xG7ZMlGiGtgFd\">TikTok Pixel l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u0111o\u1ea1n m\u00e3 JavaScript nh\u1ecf m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0o website c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh. Nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a n\u00f3 l\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 ghi l\u1ea1i h\u00e0nh vi c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng truy c\u1eadp website sau khi h\u1ecd xem ho\u1eb7c nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean TikTok. M\u1ecdi h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb xem m\u1ed9t trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng, cho \u0111\u1ebfn ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t thanh to\u00e1n \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Pixel ghi nh\u1eadn l\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-US31dPbnKo0qtpxX83SlWr56gvc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-X8wBdlHgnoO6zJx7MiTl7mCbgRh\">T\u1ea1i sao doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 nh\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o n\u00ean c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t TikTok Pixel?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BaFMd9boiokdLcxiKEOlGRgkgyh\">Vi\u1ec7c c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t Pixel kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ADc8dgJYKoCERmxtQA2lmrKcgxb\">\u0110o l\u01b0\u1eddng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P0Vsddr05oIlJdxSasRlppOJgBb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Hn0odBrodoxaMPxDDRalceAxgsf\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;42a96b89-9bfe-4fb9-a0de-5ac0fe003a1c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCMVrbVeOFod2Jvx4D1llVQJ0gvc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;CMVrbVeOFod2Jvx4D1llVQJ0gvc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:339605,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5578\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5578\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5578\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-46.png\" alt=\"\u0110o l\u01b0\u1eddng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok b\u1eb1ng TikTok Pixel\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-46.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-46-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-46-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-46-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-46-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5578\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>\u0110o l\u01b0\u1eddng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok b\u1eb1ng TikTok Pixel<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QZW1dBsu4o4o0dxtsOslTEwlgxb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OMmhdR5H6ogRhKxhAWflK3g0gBb\">L\u1ee3i \u00edch quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c. Pixel gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n bi\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o n\u00e0o, nh\u00f3m \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\u00e0o, hay n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u00e0o \u0111ang th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 t\u1ea1o ra chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i (\u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, l\u01b0\u1ee3t \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd,&#8230;), t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 cung c\u1ea5p d\u1eef li\u1ec7u minh b\u1ea1ch \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn tr\u00ean chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o (ROAS).<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QqoHdAh4No8JbtxvZICl50tigTc\">T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C1AYdoj3Hox0HixwkwgljEJ1gJb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-AAqOdWI8OoW2vPxrEASlYRhGgOc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8a6599d3-62e1-4318-ba41-e8ff2f76f8e1&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FP4unbMhdXomDSWxkimPlhlHfgcd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;P4unbMhdXomDSWxkimPlhlHfgcd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:297580,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5579\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5579\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5579\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-47.png\" alt=\"T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads b\u1eb1ng TikTok Pixel\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-47.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-47-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-47-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-47-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-47-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5579\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok Ads b\u1eb1ng TikTok Pixel<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SUx7dUm5SowRGWxVxB6lDB8fg9H\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBUOdcetYoRSpuxHGYpl6BIwgZe\">Khi Pixel thu th\u1eadp \u0111\u1ee7 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u1ec1 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i, thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n c\u1ee7a TikTok s\u1ebd &#8220;h\u1ecdc&#8221; v\u00e0 hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 ch\u00e2n dung kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. T\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a vi\u1ec7c ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i cao nh\u1ea5t, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n gi\u1ea3m chi ph\u00ed v\u00e0 t\u0103ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-J8scdLodToHxR3xFr1mlnEiYgxh\">X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng t\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CDbod83eFoCirdxAnUYl1BE1g2c\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-FgvQdFDbEo6tL3x4pIglcVTTgjF\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ec662cba-a2a8-4352-bb08-bd7f53468231&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAFXEbTmxRoPkdLxkBNalSiFYgnh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AFXEbTmxRoPkdLxkBNalSiFYgnh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:348995,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5580\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5580\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5580\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e3adb9fe-3df3-4710-8b94-0d36858ccdef.png\" alt=\"X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng t\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e3adb9fe-3df3-4710-8b94-0d36858ccdef.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e3adb9fe-3df3-4710-8b94-0d36858ccdef-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e3adb9fe-3df3-4710-8b94-0d36858ccdef-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e3adb9fe-3df3-4710-8b94-0d36858ccdef-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e3adb9fe-3df3-4710-8b94-0d36858ccdef-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5580\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng t\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DP1AdsGC4ozNzYxgUxklgwz1gQv\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JndQdKkrDohT7VxH1SBlprlIg0f\">D\u1eef li\u1ec7u m\u00e0 Pixel thu th\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i s\u1ea3n v\u00f4 gi\u00e1. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o ra c\u00e1c t\u1ec7p \u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh (Custom Audiences) nh\u1eb1m ch\u1ea1y c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb l\u1ea1i (retargeting) \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e3 truy c\u1eadp website ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecf s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng. H\u01a1n n\u1eefa, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o t\u1ec7p \u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1 (Lookalike Audiences) \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nh\u1eefng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1edbi c\u00f3 h\u00e0nh vi v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m gi\u1ed1ng h\u1ec7t t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H4Qdd2kemok2ynx48nFlvVa0gwe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QebkdpuQSoGryJxzbjPlSYwKg8g\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t TikTok Pixel l\u00ean website t\u1eeb A-Z<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dah2dEngIox9rjxKIvUllmxhgph\">Sau \u0111\u00e2y, Lemon Digital s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1eb7t TikTok Pixel:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-PumFdhSCBoikV5x751QlB45pghK\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: T\u1ea1o Pixel m\u1edbi trong Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ESzOd9kdDobFvKxNl6AlydRvgcd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-LD0vdYKSWopivVxYYp9lXCGhgEf\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;4c125761-a3e8-4d1b-b3bb-299df45b5151&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&q