bfn m\u1ee5c <strong>T\u00e0i s\u1ea3n (Assets)<\/strong> &gt; <strong>S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n (Events)<\/strong>. T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, ch\u1ecdn &#8220;Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd&#8221; \u1edf ph\u1ea7n S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n Web v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n n\u00fat &#8220;T\u1ea1o Pixel&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-WWkhdLD7woWFQBxDhFKljCx2grf\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Ch\u1ecdn ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t m\u00e3 Pixel l\u00ean website<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AM5QdcySooJXLMxAzNDlig32gpd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-FUWRdh4yyo3OkFxmLIzlRjCtggf\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b2336ce1-3601-4bcb-9e0d-56286e621765&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FA2NxbXBJ0o4tn5xx8SkltGY9gUe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;A2NxbXBJ0o4tn5xx8SkltGY9gUe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:124690,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5582\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5582\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5582\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c50c4c1b-c15d-4fab-901a-ba4e43300571.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Ch\u1ecdn ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t m\u00e3 TikTok Pixel l\u00ean website\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c50c4c1b-c15d-4fab-901a-ba4e43300571.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c50c4c1b-c15d-4fab-901a-ba4e43300571-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c50c4c1b-c15d-4fab-901a-ba4e43300571-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c50c4c1b-c15d-4fab-901a-ba4e43300571-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c50c4c1b-c15d-4fab-901a-ba4e43300571-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5582\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Ch\u1ecdn ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t m\u00e3 TikTok Pixel l\u00ean website<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"NF5Pdepsmozsj0xYSLOly3cVggg\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UW69ddtrOoT3WexS0R8lDBMagWd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M3ugdlmZBokPVExfaS0lX6k4gxc\">Sau khi \u0111\u1eb7t t\u00ean cho Pixel, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u00f3 hai ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t ch\u00ednh:<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-KG37dE4Ccoo3RWxSatPlzrl0gNg\">C\u00e1ch 1: C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng (D\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi bi\u1ebft v\u1ec1 code)<\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BblndXdKuopXgIx8JGrlLbNagQb\">V\u1edbi c\u00e1ch n\u00e0y, TikTok s\u1ebd cung c\u1ea5p cho b\u1ea1n m\u1ed9t \u0111o\u1ea1n m\u00e3 Pixel c\u01a1 s\u1edf. B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n sao ch\u00e9p \u0111o\u1ea1n m\u00e3 n\u00e0y v\u00e0 d\u00e1n n\u00f3 v\u00e0o gi\u1eefa c\u1eb7p th\u1ebb &lt;head&gt; v\u00e0 &lt;\/head&gt; tr\u00ean m\u1ecdi trang c\u1ee7a website. Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p n\u00e0y \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c v\u1ec1 HTML ho\u1eb7c c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o m\u00e3 ngu\u1ed3n c\u1ee7a trang web.<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-OvlpdyQkfoVyRDxum9rlwn05gTc\">C\u00e1ch 2: C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t qua Google Tag Manager (Ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n)<\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CgPCdFfPtoEPMixm4cqlB2f4ghh\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c khuy\u00ean d\u00f9ng cho h\u1ea7u h\u1ebft m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi v\u00ec t\u00ednh an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i. B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ebfn code c\u1ee7a website, ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n sao ch\u00e9p <strong>ID Pixel<\/strong> t\u1eeb TikTok. Sau \u0111\u00f3, truy c\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Google Tag Manager, t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t th\u1ebb m\u1edbi, ch\u1ecdn m\u1eabu &#8220;TikTok Pixel&#8221; c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n, d\u00e1n ID v\u00e0o v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp tr\u00ecnh k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t l\u00e0 &#8220;T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c trang&#8221; (All Pages).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XE9MdRoWwo0A7FxgPaAlHlgTgWf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JWeGdkTJkoMPdGxkIOXlubKhggh\">C\u00e1ch thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LI8ydolNQoLEJmxmprtlGyrAgEb\">Sau khi \u0111\u00e3 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t m\u00e3 Pixel c\u01a1 s\u1edf, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n cho Pixel bi\u1ebft nh\u1eefng h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng n\u00e0o tr\u00ean website l\u00e0 quan tr\u1ecdng c\u1ea7n theo d\u00f5i. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n n\u00e0y b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 Event Builder c\u1ee7a TikTok m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n code.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-PiIZd370YoUEtvxYp4RlvsmJg4g\">Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n theo l\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp URL<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXhOdnrM7oqkuFx6sWzlPpRugAg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-PdFddP4xbotc