cord-id-Dx9Rd7XYHoneRexZKT7lp0VggRe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UrVNd7oNiorNysxZ8eclAVfOgJe\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u1ea5t, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd ho\u1eb7c mua h\u00e0ng. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n nh\u1eadp URL c\u1ee7a trang &#8220;c\u1ea3m \u01a1n&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng&#8221; (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: yourwebsite.com\/thank-you), sau \u0111\u00f3 g\u00e1n n\u00f3 v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng nh\u01b0 &#8220;Ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;Ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t thanh to\u00e1n&#8221;.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Ay22dLpo4oP1mWxLriXlmZFjgQb\">Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n theo l\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5p chu\u1ed9t kh\u00e1c (inbox, g\u1ecdi,&#8230;)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MAf7dSzqNoeg5uxDe7Fl5KPngmg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-SrZUdsFxEosibixsx9pl9bDLgBc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;fd6d87a3-c714-4a36-8de8-ee95328fea31&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FW0mEbzqL7o5gPhxcv8PldUMUgpN%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;W0mEbzqL7o5gPhxcv8PldUMUgpN&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:127278,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5584\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5584\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5584\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c8a6220d-1ffc-4feb-844b-93c9370c8034.png\" alt=\"Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n theo l\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5p chu\u1ed9t\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c8a6220d-1ffc-4feb-844b-93c9370c8034.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c8a6220d-1ffc-4feb-844b-93c9370c8034-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c8a6220d-1ffc-4feb-844b-93c9370c8034-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c8a6220d-1ffc-4feb-844b-93c9370c8034-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/c8a6220d-1ffc-4feb-844b-93c9370c8034-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5584\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n theo l\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5p chu\u1ed9t<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TwjWdP6mwocMAexsjOJlTmaegzd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CmYMdNhQZoxoZuxunvRlPty2gMc\">Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p n\u00e0y d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t n\u00fat c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 tr\u00ean trang. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a TikTok \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn c\u00e1c n\u00fat nh\u01b0 &#8220;Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;G\u1eedi li\u00ean h\u1ec7&#8221; v\u00e0 g\u00e1n ch\u00fang v\u1edbi c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xjhudo6uyoI09rxbzk9lCPkqgXd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-LMZKdcE3dolzRlxYeCvlZpDJgAb\">Ki\u1ec3m tra v\u00e0 x\u00e1c minh TikTok Pixel \u0111\u00e3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng hay ch\u01b0a?<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-UDE1dORaeoht00xgbWclhqPZgDc\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ti\u1ec7n \u00edch TikTok Pixel Helper 2.0<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXLfdgRYrowQA3xYv1FlAZjwgad\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Uxlgdqs6QohYaMxYwhdlIhtXgwc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b38b91ea-32f0-438f-a4c3-29a2b1545fc9&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FP2PBbTEyAo5WRtxgdL0l9IThggh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;P2PBbTEyAo5WRtxgdL0l9IThggh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:126812,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5585\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5585\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5585\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7a7c3aa8-e362-4de6-a794-c59af68b8b28.png\" alt=\"S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ti\u1ec7n \u00edch TikTok Pixel Helper 2.0\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7a7c3aa8-e362-4de6-a794-c59af68b8b28.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7a7c3aa8-e362-4de6-a794-c59af68b8b28-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7a7c3aa8-e362-4de6-a794-c59af68b8b28-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7a7c3aa8-e362-4de6-a794-c59af68b8b28-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/7a7c3aa8-e362-4de6-a794-c59af68b8b28-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5585\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ti\u1ec7n \u00edch TikTok Pixel Helper 2.0<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EpAjdMeSeoK73OxzROtlbPkEgOc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AiFedZacLoyTAcxX78RlpdjcgUd\">\u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o Pixel \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch, h\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ti\u1ec7n \u00edch m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng (extension) <strong>TikTok Pixel Helper 2.0<\/strong> tr\u00ean tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t Chrome. Sau khi c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t, h\u00e3y truy c\u1eadp website c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a ti\u1ec7n \u00edch n\u00e0y. N\u1ebfu Pixel ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng, n\u00f3 s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb ID Pixel v\u00e0 t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111ang \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ghi nh\u1eadn tr\u00ean trang \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8pTdialwoJ0OsxD5Y3lqtAqgJg\">TikTok Pixel l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd, \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 l\u00e0 c\u1ea7u n\u1ed1i d\u1eef li\u1ec7u kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu gi\u1eefa n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok v\u00e0 website c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Hy v\u1ecdng v\u1edbi b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 cung c\u1ea5p cho b\u1ea1n chi ti\u1ebft th\u00f4ng tin v\u1ec1 vi\u1ec7c c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 tr\u00ean \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u v\u00e0 m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng quy m\u00f4 c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch th\u00f4ng minh v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-li